    {
      "id": "l6",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "Don't put all your eggs in one basket",
      "pages": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "Don't put all your eggs in one basket"
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "image": "obrazki/2-nie-wkladaj-jajek-do-jednego-2.png",
              "width": 1,
              "maxHeight": 240,
              "caption": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Diversification** means splitting your money between different, unrelated investments to **reduce risk**."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "When one company goes bust or a whole industry hits a crisis, the loss is **balanced out** by the rest of the portfolio."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "minigame": {
        "game": "",
        "settings": []
      },
      "tasks": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l7",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "Effective diversification",
      "pages": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "Effective diversification"
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "image": "obrazki/3-skuteczna-dywersyfikacja.png",
              "width": 1,
              "maxHeight": 240,
              "caption": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Diversification is built **on several levels**:"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                "**Industries** – e.g. technology, healthcare, energy",
                "**Regions** – e.g. the US, Europe, emerging markets",
                "**Asset classes** – stocks, bonds, cash"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Such a portfolio copes better when one sector collapses and gives **steadier results** over the long term."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "minigame": {
        "game": "",
        "settings": []
      },
